- Cites: REQUIREMENT, DECISION, MECHANISM, EVIDENCE, USE_CASE, NARRATIVE, WORK
- Contains: NARRATIVE
- Over: NARRATIVE
- Guarantees: REQUIREMENT
- Assumes: DECISION, MECHANISM, WORK
- Superseded_By: DECISION
